6224139\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234631\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Gold Angel\"><img alt=\"Gold Angel\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203234631\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/2/24/DFF_Ultimate_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110204003934\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Delusory Warlock\"><img alt=\"Delusory Warlock\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"29\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Ultimate Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Ultimate_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/2/24/DFF_Ultimate_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/29?cb=20110204003934\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/2/24/DFF_Ultimate_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110204003934\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Counterfeit Wraith\"><img alt=\"Counterfeit Wraith\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"29\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Ultimate Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Ultimate_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/2/24/DFF_Ultimate_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/29?cb=20110204003934\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>First, beat the enemy at C4, then move to G5 and use a Multichain to get the rest of them, avoiding all those pesky red emblems. The KP Chance is a 60 second win.\n</p><p>First, a Level 125 Ephemeral Vision with Omega and an Ephemeral Summoner, and you're forced to fight on a Physical Damage 0 emblem. Then, chain and Party time! Enter the opposition - a Level 128 Ephemeral Phantom with Omega, a Level 128 Lady of Antiquity with Ultima Weapon, and a Level 129 Warrior of Antiquity with Omega and an Idle Sky Pirate. Then comes a Level 126 Delusory Warlock with Omega and a Delusory Knight, a Level 125 Imitation Despot with Omega and an Imitation Liegeman, a Level 125 False Stalwart with Ultima Weapon and a False Hero, and finally a Level 126 Counterfeit Wraith with Ultima Weapon and a Counterfeit Youth.\n</p><p>The chest has a Gold Angel, grab it, take the moogle chalice, and head out.\n</p><p>Beyond the gateway is a dead end with a Moogle. He sells the Adamantite and Samurai Spirit accessories, needed to trade for the top-grade Level 100 Adamant and Genji sets. The two sets are both three-set combinations, though they have pieces in all four equipment types. Adamant Chains boosts your Bravery every time you dodge an attack and increases the distance you move when you dodge in midair, making it easier to dodge attacks, while the Genji set's Blessing of Yamato gives you +3 luck, +20% HP Regen, converts extra HP from any regeneration into Bravery, and raises the rate at which EX Cores appear. The moogle also sells the four pieces of the Snowpetal set, there's no weapon of the set but two hand pieces, its combination doubles the power of deflected magic attacks and also gives you a nice boost to your Bravery when you block an attack, equal to 30% of your base Bravery. All three are excellent equipment pieces, some of the best in the game, go nuts if you're tired of the Lufenian stuff. The moogle also sells the Omega, Hecatoncheir and Ultima Weapon summons, buy all three.\n</p><p>Well, that was worth the trip huh kiddies? Time to get to the proper quest now, head back to the entrance of the Land of Discord.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Return_to_Onrac\">Return to Onrac</span><a title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Return to Onrac\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Walkthrough:Dissidia_012_Final_Fantasy/Drake/Part_26?action=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Return to Onrac\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Take the left path now to reach the Confinement and Flight gateway.\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/11/D012_Silver_Moogle_Chalice.png/revision/latest?cb=20121006224139\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"KP Silver Cup\"><img alt=\"KP Silver Cup\"  deco